Poolboy remains licensed as described in LICENSE. The upstream notice above is
retained for Helicopter-derived material. Poolboy-specific additions and
deliberate differences are described in CONTRIBUTING.md and MAINTAINERS.md.
Poolboy's Linear-only intake makes Helicopter's GitHub-Issue-linked queue
supersession behavior non-applicable; the existing whose-turn queue remains.
No hosted activation has occurred in Poolboy, and Helicopter's hosted
configurator, self-development, and release tooling are not shipped here.
Poolboy also retains its explicitly authorized mechanical DCO-trailer exception:
the human certifies the contribution; an agent may insert that human's trailer
only with explicit authorization, rather than Helicopter's blanket prohibition.
